2. What the existing FUN contracts permit

The runtimes are 3,554 bytes each, including identical metadata. SHA-256 over decoded runtime bytes: 4f263d8e18d84b27961a38f64f506809909118222a953786a5851b499e0cf8fa.

Their dispatch tables expose name, symbol, decimals, totalSupply, balanceOf, allowance, transfer, approve, and transferFrom. The decimals function returns 18. The creation logs show 20 tokens per contract. No external-call, delegatecall, contract-creation, or self-destruct opcode was found in the runtime after excluding compiler metadata.

